    "detailed_description": "ABYSSEY is a strategy log-like game with Pixel Horizontal Scroll View!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet jewelry and get a job! You get one job depending on the jewelry you're wearing!<br />\r\nDepending on your job, you will be able to use your own basic attacks and skills!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are a total of 16 jobs, and you can experience new plays every time!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can also gain item synergies, and item synergies can earn additional skills and stats to complement your job skills!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can strengthen your items to make your current skills and synergy stronger!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are more than 60 items. Try combine them in a variety of ways!<br />\r\nAnd, Beat enemies and bosses by creating my own synergy combination!",
